<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#employs> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a ThreatActor to an AttackPattern, Malware, Technique, or Tool it deliberately puts into operational use."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#employs> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "employs"@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#employs> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use for curated ThreatActor relationships where deliberate operational use is intended. As a subproperty of the open STIX-compatible stonework:uses relationship, employs assertions remain available to queries over the broader interoperability predicate."@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#evidencedBy
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#evidencedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#evidencedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Sighting> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#evidencedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#DigitalArtifact> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#evidencedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Sighting is substantiated by this DigitalArtifact (memory dump, PCAP, log excerpt, sample). Connects analytical observation to forensic evidence."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#evidencedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "evidencedBy"@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#executedOn
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#executedOn> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
