<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#fundsActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A cyber activity that this transaction finances — for example an infrastructure purchase linked to the campaign or operation it supports."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#fundsActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "fundsActivity"@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#fundsActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This property asserts a financing relationship. For a payment made in response to an activity without financing it, such as a victim's ransom payment made because of an incident, use stonework:respondsToActivity."@en .
