# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardOperator
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardOperator> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardOperator> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardOperator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Transition> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardOperator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#ComparisonOperator> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardOperator> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The comparison operator applied between guardVariable's bound literal value and guardLiteralValue."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardOperator> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "guardOperator" .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardOperator> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Omitted = Equals, preserving equality-only guard semantics without requiring this property on every Transition."@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardType
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Transition> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardType> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Transition fires only if guardVariable's stonework:boundTo value is an instance of this class."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardType> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "guardType" .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardType> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Used for guards that test whether a Variable was bound to an instance of a particular class (e.g. testing that an attempt's outcome Variable was bound to a stonework:SecurityCondition instance) rather than testing equality against a scalar."@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardVariable
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardVariable> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardVariable> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Transition> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Variable> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The Variable whose bound value is tested to decide whether a Transition is taken."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#guardVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "guardVariable" .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasAccount
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasAccount> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasAccount> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#accountOf> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasAccount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Agent> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasAccount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Account> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasAccount> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Account (user account or financial account) held by, or beneficially attributed to, this Agent."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasAccount> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasAccount"@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasAccountType
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasAccountType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasAccountType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#categorizedBy> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasAccountType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#UserAccount> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasAccountType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#AccountType> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasAccountType> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a user account to one or more classifications describing its authentication or deployment context."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasAccountType> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasAccountType"@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasArtifact
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasArtifact> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasArtifact> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#MalwareSample> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasArtifact> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#DigitalArtifact> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasArtifact> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Links a MalwareSample to a captured binary artifact (file, memory dump, or encoded payload) constituting the physical evidence of the sample."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasArtifact> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasArtifact"@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasArtifact> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Optional — a MalwareSample may be known via hashes or threat reports without the binary being available. When present, the artifact provides retrievable binary evidence. Corresponds to the STIX 2.1 sample_refs property on the malware SDO."@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasBehavior
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasBehavior> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasBehavior> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Behavior> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasBehavior> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Associates a MalwareSample, AttackPattern, ThreatActor, or Campaign with an observed Behavior. Enables behavioral clustering and similarity reasoning."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasBehavior> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasBehavior"@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasBomEntry
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasBomEntry> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasBomEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#SoftwareBillOfMaterials> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasBomEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#BomEntry> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasBomEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a Software Bill of Materials to one of its component entries."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasBomEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "has BOM entry" .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasBomEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Each BomEntry carries the component's VersionedProduct reference (via stonework:installationOf) and any component-specific metadata (PURL, license, hash, component type). Range is BomEntry rather than VersionedProduct directly because the same VersionedProduct may appear in multiple SBOMs with different component-level attributes."@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasCvssMetric
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasCvssMetric> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasCvssMetric> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricFor> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasCvssMetric> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Vulnerability> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasCvssMetric> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#CvssMetric> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasCvssMetric> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a vulnerability to a structured CVSS metric record carrying the version, vector string, and base/temporal/environmental scores."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasCvssMetric> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasCvssMetric"@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasCvssMetric> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "A single vulnerability may carry metrics for multiple CVSS versions (2.0, 3.1, 4.0) or scoring authorities. For a single headline score and severity, use stonework:cvssBaseScore and stonework:cvssSeverity directly on the Vulnerability. Core consumers can represent the common structured fields without an adapter; load the CVSS framework module for decomposed vector components and additional subscores."@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasDependency
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasDependency> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasDependency> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#dependencyOf> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasDependency> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#VersionedProduct> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasDependency> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#VersionedProduct> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasDependency> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a product version to another product version it depends on."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasDependency> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasDependency"@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasDestinationAddress
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasDestinationAddress> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasDestinationAddress> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#NetworkTraffic> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasDestinationAddress> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#IPAddress> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasDestinationAddress> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates NetworkTraffic to the destination IP address."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasDestinationAddress> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasDestinationAddress"@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasEmail
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasEmail> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasEmail> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Agent> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasEmail> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#EmailAddress> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasEmail> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An EmailAddress associated with this Agent."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasEmail> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasEmail" .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasEvent
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasEvent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Incident> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Event> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an Incident to an Event that forms part of its recorded activity."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasEvent"@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasExecution
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasExecution> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasExecution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Behavior> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasExecution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#CyberActivity> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasExecution> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a Behavior plan to a CyberActivity that executes it."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasExecution> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasExecution"@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasFalsePositiveRate
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasFalsePositiveRate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasFalsePositiveRate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#categorizedBy> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasFalsePositiveRate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#DetectionRule> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasFalsePositiveRate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#FalsePositiveRate> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasFalsePositiveRate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a detection rule to an ordinal assessment of its expected false-positive frequency."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasFalsePositiveRate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasFalsePositiveRate"@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasHash
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasHash> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasHash> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Hash> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasHash> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an entity to its hash entries. The range is a stonework:Hash individual representing a single hash algorithm and digest value." .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasHash> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasHash" .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasHypothesisStatus
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasHypothesisStatus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasHypothesisStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#categorizedBy> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasHypothesisStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Hypothesis> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasHypothesisStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#HypothesisStatus> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasHypothesisStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a Hypothesis to its current status in the confirm/refute lifecycle."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasHypothesisStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasHypothesisStatus"@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasHypothesisStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Kept explicit (rather than inferred from which Transition fired) so a Hypothesis's status is directly queryable without replaying the Step graph it was tested in."@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasIPBlock
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasIPBlock> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasIPBlock> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#AutonomousSystem> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasIPBlock> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#IPBlock> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasIPBlock> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an AutonomousSystem to an IPBlock it originates or announces."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasIPBlock> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasIPBlock"@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasIdentifier
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#DigitalIdentity> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Identifier> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Links a Digital Identity to one or more atomic Identifiers that belong to it." .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasIdentifier" .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasImpact
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasImpact> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasImpact> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Risk> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasImpact> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Impact> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasImpact> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a Risk to its associated Impact component."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasImpact> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasImpact"@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasImpactLevel
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasImpactLevel> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasImpactLevel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#categorizedBy> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasImpactLevel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Impact> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasImpactLevel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#ImpactLevel> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasImpactLevel> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an impact assessment to its qualitative magnitude."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasImpactLevel> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasImpactLevel"@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#hasImpactType
