# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#madeBySensor
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#madeBySensor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#madeBySensor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#SecurityObservation> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#madeBySensor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Sensor> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#madeBySensor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-ssn/#SOSAmadeBySensor> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#madeBySensor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Links a SecurityObservation to the Sensor that produced it."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#madeBySensor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "madeBySensor"@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#madeBySensor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Inspired by SOSA sosa:madeBySensor. Enables queries such as 'which sensor produced this observation?' and 'what has this IDS sensor observed in the last 24 hours?' The producing sensor may also be the created_by_ref identity in the STIX wire format."@en .
