<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#subdomainOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "This Domain is a subdomain of the specified parent Domain. Transitive: if A is a subdomain of B and B of C, then A is a subdomain of C."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#subdomainOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "subdomainOf" .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#subsidiary
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#subsidiary> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#subsidiary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Organization> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#subsidiary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Organization> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#subsidiary> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an Organization to a subsidiary organization it owns or controls."@en .
