<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#toStep> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The Step a Transition enters."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#toStep> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "toStep" .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#toStep> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "A Transition whose toStep was already reached earlier in the same Behavior's Step graph expresses a loop back-edge; a self-loop (toStep equal to fromStep) is the degenerate case."@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#transactionCurrency
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#transactionCurrency> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
