<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#transactionCurrency> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Convenience projection of the currency of a single-denomination transaction's stonework:MonetaryAmount, for consumers that need one value without traversing stonework:hasMonetaryValue."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#transactionCurrency> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "transactionCurrency"@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#transactionCurrency> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Do not use for a currency exchange with distinct input and output currencies; traverse stonework:originatorMonetaryValue and stonework:beneficiaryMonetaryValue to their stonework:currency values instead."@en .
