<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#usesInfrastructure> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates malware, a product, cyber activity, or agent to infrastructure it uses."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#usesInfrastructure> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "usesInfrastructure"@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#usesInfrastructure> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use for an operational dependency on infrastructure, such as malware using command-and-control infrastructure, a CyberActivityCluster or Campaign using hosting infrastructure, a product using a supporting service, or an Agent using infrastructure in an operation. This relationship asserts use, not ownership, compromise, or attribution."@en .
