<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#blockchainNetwork> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The distributed ledger a crypto asset is native to or issued on (e.g. Bitcoin, Ethereum, Tron, Monero). The same nominal token issued on more than one ledger is modeled as distinct CryptoAsset individuals."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#blockchainNetwork> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "blockchainNetwork"@en .
