<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#bomFormat> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The exchange format and version in which a Bill of Materials was originally serialized (e.g. 'CycloneDX 1.6', 'SPDX 2.3')." .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#bomFormat> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "BOM format" .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#bomFormat> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Domain intentionally left unset. Serves as provenance metadata on stonework:SoftwareBillOfMaterials instances, distinguishing the source format from the STONEWORK representation." .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#boundToLiteral
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#boundToLiteral> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#boundToLiteral> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
