<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#created> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Compatibility alias for dcterms:created. Prefer dcterms:created in newly authored data."@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cveId
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cveId> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cveId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#vulnerabilityId> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cveId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Vulnerability> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cveId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cveId> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The CVE identifier in the format CVE-YYYY-NNNNN."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cveId> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "cveId"@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cveId> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Retained as the STONEWORK-level CVE-specific identifier. cve:cveId (declared rdfs:subPropertyOf this property) is the source-native alias always present on data ingested from CVE JSON; query this property for cross-source lookups."@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssBaseScore
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssBaseScore> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssBaseScore> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssBaseScore> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Vulnerability> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssBaseScore> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssBaseScore> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The headline context-neutral CVSS base score for this vulnerability, on a 0.0–10.0 scale."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssBaseScore> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "cvssBaseScore"@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssBaseScore> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "When multiple CVSS versions are present, this SHOULD reflect the highest available version (CVSS 4.0 preferred over 3.1, 3.1 over 2.0). For full structured metric data across all CVSS versions use stonework:hasCvssMetric."@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricBaseScore
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricBaseScore> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricBaseScore> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricBaseScore> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#CvssMetric> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricBaseScore> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricBaseScore> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The base score calculated by a structured CVSS assessment, on a 0.0-10.0 scale."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricBaseScore> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "cvssMetricBaseScore"@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricBaseScore> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "cve:baseScore (on cve:CvssMetric) is declared rdfs:subPropertyOf this property (one-way)."@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricBaseSeverity
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricBaseSeverity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
