<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricBaseSeverity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#CvssMetric> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricBaseSeverity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricBaseSeverity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The qualitative severity corresponding to a structured CVSS assessment's base score."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricBaseSeverity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "cvssMetricBaseSeverity"@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricBaseSeverity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "cve:baseSeverity (on cve:CvssMetric) is declared rdfs:subPropertyOf this property (one-way)."@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricVector
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricVector> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
