<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricVector> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#CvssMetric> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricVector> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricVector> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The complete vector string used by a structured CVSS assessment."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricVector> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "cvssMetricVector"@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricVector> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "cve:vectorString (on cve:CvssMetric) is declared rdfs:subPropertyOf this property (one-way)."@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricVersion
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricVersion> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricVersion> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricVersion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#CvssMetric> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricVersion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricVersion> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The CVSS specification version used by a structured assessment, such as 3.1 or 4.0."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricVersion> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "cvssMetricVersion"@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssMetricVersion> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "cve:version carries this same value on cve:CvssMetric as a plain string, but is not declared a subproperty of this property because cve:version is shared with cve:VersionRange, a class this property's domain does not cover."@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssScore
