<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssSeverity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssSeverity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The qualitative CVSS severity rating corresponding to the headline base score: NONE, LOW, MEDIUM, HIGH, or CRITICAL."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#cvssSeverity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "cvssSeverity"@en .
# 
