<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#dateAssigned> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Vulnerability> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#dateAssigned> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#dateAssigned> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The date and time at which a vulnerability identifier was assigned by the relevant numbering authority."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#dateAssigned> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "dateAssigned"@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#dateAssigned> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Corresponds to cveMetadata.dateReserved in CVE JSON 5.x and equivalent assignment timestamps from other vulnerability sources. cve:dateAssigned is declared rdfs:subPropertyOf this property (one-way)."@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#datePublic
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#datePublic> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
