<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#dateUpdated> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The date and time at which the vulnerability record was last modified in its source database."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#dateUpdated> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "dateUpdated"@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#dateUpdated> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Corresponds to cveMetadata.dateUpdated in CVE JSON 5.x and equivalent update timestamps from other vulnerability sources. cve:dateUpdated is declared rdfs:subPropertyOf this property (one-way)."@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#description
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#description> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
