<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#description> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Domain is intentionally unset so framework-specific descriptions for vulnerabilities, weaknesses, attack patterns, and threat objects can share this canonical property. Prefer stonework:description in newly authored data."@en .
