# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#variableName
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#variableName> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
