<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#variableName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#variableName> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A short name identifying a Variable within the scope of its declaring Behavior, allowing it to be referenced consistently across Steps and Transitions."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#variableName> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "variableName" .
