<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#version> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "version"@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#vulnerabilityId
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#vulnerabilityId> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#vulnerabilityId> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#vulnerabilityId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#Vulnerability> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#vulnerabilityId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#vulnerabilityId> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The canonical identifier assigned to this vulnerability by its originating numbering authority, e.g. 'CVE-2021-44228', 'GHSA-jfh8-c2jp-hdp9', or 'OSV-2021-1'."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#vulnerabilityId> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "vulnerabilityId"@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#vulnerabilityId> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Identifier-specific core properties such as stonework:cveId are declared as subproperties (and source-native framework aliases such as cve:cveId are declared subproperties of those), enabling cross-source queries on a single predicate. Each vulnerability record SHOULD carry exactly one identifier from its primary numbering authority."@en .
# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#walletAddress
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#walletAddress> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#walletAddress> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#CryptoAddress> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#walletAddress> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#walletAddress> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The on-chain address string (e.g. a Bitcoin or Ethereum address)."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#walletAddress> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "walletAddress"@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#walletAddress> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Resolve the address's asset through ^stonework:hasIdentifier/stonework:accountCurrency and then its ledger through stonework:blockchainNetwork on a stonework:CryptoAsset. Do not rely on the address string alone to identify the asset or network."@en .
