# 
# https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#RemoteAccessTrojan
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#RemoteAccessTrojan> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
