<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#RemoteAccessTrojan> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "remote-access-trojan" .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#RemoteAccessTrojan> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Malware providing covert remote control of an infected host, typically including capabilities such as file access, screen capture, keylogging, and command execution."@en .
