<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#indicator> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An assertion that a specific pattern or set of Digital Artifacts is associated with malicious behavior, enabling detection, correlation, and response."@en .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#indicator> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#categoryScheme> .
