<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#threatActorTypeActivist> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "activist" .
<https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stonework#threatActorTypeActivist> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A threat actor motivated by political, social, or ideological causes, using cyber means to advance their agenda."@en .
